// Matching Single-Column Typst Cover Letter Template

#set document(title: "FULL NAME - Cover Letter", author: "FULL NAME")
#set page(paper: "a4", margin: (x: 0.85in, y: 0.85in), numbering: none)
#set text(
  font: ("Liberation Sans", "DejaVu Sans", "Arial", "Helvetica"),
  size: 10.5pt,
  lang: "en",
)
#set par(justify: false, leading: 0.65em, spacing: 1.15em)

#block(below: 1.4em)[
  #text(size: 18pt, weight: "bold")[FULL NAME] \
  #v(0.2em)
  City, Country | #link("mailto:email@example.com")[email\@example.com] | +1-555-0100 | #link("https://linkedin.com/in/username")[linkedin.com/in/username] | #link("https://github.com/username")[github.com/username]
]

Month Day, Year

*Hiring Team* \
Company Name

*Re: Application for Target Role Title*

Dear Hiring Team,

Opening paragraph connecting your genuine interest in Company Name's mission/product with a clear 1-sentence summary of the engineering value you bring to the Target Role Title position.

Second paragraph detailing a concrete production accomplishment with quantified metrics that directly mirrors the core technical challenges described in the job posting.

Third paragraph highlighting complementary strengths, open-source/GitHub proof, or cross-functional ownership that elevates team execution.

Thank you for your time and consideration. I would welcome the opportunity to discuss how my experience can contribute to Company Name's roadmap.

Sincerely,

#v(0.6em)
*Full Name*
